      "description": "Vee have vays of making you enjoy zee exhibition! The former board school in what is now Ouzel Square has been transformed into the Ikon Gallery.  This runs a wide range of exhibitions of modern art.  One of the current \"installations\" involves strapping visitors to a board and sliding them out of this 2nd floor window as seen in the picture.  Although they are sometimes pushed further out than seen here, they do get to be pulled back inside again afterwards!",
